# Keep the UI

Match the LU IDea mock. Do not restyle to default shadcn look. Do not port `style.css` class names.

# Tailwind

Put utilities on the element. `globals.css` holds theme tokens and existing base only — no new `.hero` / `.btn-primary` classes.

# Components

UI lives only in the existing tree:

- `src/components/ui` — shadcn primitives (restyle these to match LU)
- `src/components/atoms`
- `src/components/molecules`
- `src/components/organisms`

Do not add `src/modules`, `src/features`, or a second `components` folder. Group extra files by component name only (`organisms/site-header/`), never by page or feature.

# shadcn first

Use `@/ui/*`. If a primitive is missing, add an atom or molecule. Allowed non-UI folders: `src/app`, `src/lib`, `src/schemas`, `src/store`, `src/providers`.
